    <meta name="description" content="The Department of Mechanical Engineering is one of the largest departments in the Institute, with 62 full-time faculty membes and over 50 full-time administrative and technical support staff. The department offers B.Tech., B.Tech. + M.Tech. (Dual Degree), M.Tech., and Ph.D. degree programs, with over 650 undergraduate, 200 M.Tech. and 250 Ph.D. students on roll. The department has over 30 instructional and research laboratories, equipped with some of the state-of-the-art scientific instruments and systems.">
